{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Split</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The accident has left you quantumly untethered (whatever that means), meaning that with every new weapon you try to pick up, you instead create a new timeline where you wield that weapon, which you must now play alongside your base reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Shoot</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every version of yourself controls the same, but the world around them is disconnected from other timelines. Make sure to keep track on each of them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Sacrifice</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone has to make it to the finish, as long as there's at least one of you still standing by the end that's a win in our book</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first level of the game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340520?t=1731998843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340520?t=1731998843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340520/79f9a81784633025f37bd4527b0ff13878f4efe4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731998843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340520/79f9a81784633025f37bd4527b0ff13878f4efe4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731998843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Split</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The accident has left you quantumly untethered (whatever that means), meaning that with every new weapon you try to pick up, you instead create a new timeline where you wield that weapon, which you must now play alongside your base reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Shoot</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every version of yourself controls the same, but the world around them is disconnected from other timelines. Make sure to keep track on each of them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Sacrifice</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone has to make it to the finish, as long as there's at least one of you still standing by the end that's a win in our book</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first level of the game</p>","developers":["Cooper Heriot","Sarah Nguyen","Jessie Hazim"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3295080","name":"ParaGlock"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340520/header.jpg?t=1731998843","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257071802,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071802/movie480.mp4?t=1731998836","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071802/movie_max.mp4?t=1731998836"},"name":"ParaGlockGameplayDemo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257071802/13ac906cebece1a73a92bb768a7fb4f199b3d3c8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731998836","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071802/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1731998836","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071802/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1731998836"}}],"name":"ParaGlock Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 800 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong>